# CATEGORY: intent-admission / one-shot rising-edge
# CLAIM: admit a held submit signal only on a witnessed rising edge.
#
# Stream mapping:
#   i1 = submit flag
#   o1 = one-shot admit flag
#
# Contract:
#   o1[t] = i1[t] & ~i1[t-1]
#
# This is input-history only. It avoids output feedback, so it preserves one
# output row per input step under the runtime Tau runner. In both supported Tau
# builds, a high first input is fail-closed because no prior-low edge was
# observed.
set charvar off

always
  (o1[t]:sbf = (i1[t]:sbf & (i1[t-1]:sbf)')).
end
